PTX MP+mbarrier-try_wait-relaxed+fence-restrict+global
"As MP+mbarrier-try_wait-relaxed+fence-restrict with the data in global memory: the restricted acquire fence does not order it (D18). Expected: allowed."
{
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 1;
d=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                          | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0                             ;
 st.weak.global d, 1                               | mbarrier.try_wait.parity.relaxed.cluster r0, b, 0    ;
 mbarrier.arrive.release.cluster.shared::cluster b | fence.acquire.sync_restrict::shared::cluster.cluster ;
                                                   | ld.weak.global r1, d                                 ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
